data: {"id": "2ec8789782a84623-thinking-parallel_evidence-548", "run_id": "2ec8789782a84623", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n- **Pod 状态**：`phase=Pending`，`nodeName=None`，`PodScheduled=False`。\n- **调度事件 (Events)**：`Warning FailedScheduling`，持续 77 分钟，重复 13 次。完整原文为：\n  > \"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Preemption is not helpful for scheduling.\"\n- **Pod 调度约束 (YAML)**：`nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}`。\n- **节点容量**：3 个节点 (master, node1, node2) 均有充足 CPU 资源 (allocatable 12-18 CPU)。\n- **Metrics**：PromQL 确认 `kube_pod_sta", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789040548968, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

